WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.085 --> 00:00:09.614
Polly and Jack have a wagon.

2
00:00:09.615 --> 00:00:13.542
Huh? I saw that wagon yesterday.

3
00:00:13.543 --> 00:00:21.741
I don't think it belongs to them.

4
00:00:21.742 --> 00:00:24.330
Polly: Good afternoon,

5
00:00:24.331 --> 00:00:34.675
Omar! Jack: Hello, Omar! We're

6
00:00:34.676 --> 00:00:43.630
here. Where are you, Omar?

7
00:00:43.631 --> 00:00:55.162
Polly: We came to help you!

8
00:00:55.163 --> 00:00:58.231
Jack: Hmm. I don't think he's here.

9
00:00:58.232 --> 00:01:09.964
Polly: Oh no! Do you think he's gone?

10
00:01:09.965 --> 00:01:18.413
Omar: Hello, Jack. Good afternoon, Polly.

11
00:01:18.414 --> 00:01:21.594
Jack: Omar! You are

12
00:01:21.595 --> 00:01:23.720
here! Polly: We're so happy to see

13
00:01:23.721 --> 00:01:28.072
you! We want to work today.

14
00:01:28.073 --> 00:01:33.885
Omar: Good. You can move those sacks of grain.

15
00:01:33.886 --> 00:01:35.977
Jack: No problem!

16
00:01:35.978 --> 00:01:37.874
Polly: We're happy to help.

17
00:01:37.875 --> 00:01:49.156
Omar: Thank you!

18
00:01:49.157 --> 00:01:57.823
Jack: Look! The air is sparkling, Polly!

19
00:01:57.824 --> 00:02:00.546
Polly: We're in a

20
00:02:00.547 --> 00:02:05.024
house. No one is home.

21
00:02:05.025 --> 00:02:11.900
Jack: I see three beds in that room.

22
00:02:11.901 --> 00:02:23.381
Polly: And there are three chairs here.

23
00:02:23.382 --> 00:02:30.271
Jack: Huh? Look over there.

24
00:02:30.272 --> 00:02:35.074
There are three bowls of porridge too. Polly:

25
00:02:35.075 --> 00:02:37.974
I'm hungry! Jack:

26
00:02:37.975 --> 00:02:45.089
Me too.

27
00:02:45.090 --> 00:02:47.762
Polly: Can we eat some?

28
00:02:47.763 --> 00:02:53.711
Jack: I don't know, Polly. It's not our porridge.

29
00:02:53.712 --> 00:02:57.939
Polly: But no one is here.

